WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:13.000
Prism opens the Broken Circuitry project. Tapping a track and Open patch shows its synthesis graph: the glass track is additive partials through a smoother. Audition plays it.

00:13.000 --> 00:26.000
The glow track's patch is a phase operator: FM synthesis.

00:26.000 --> 00:39.000
The bell track is a modal bank, a physical model of a resonant body.

00:39.000 --> 00:51.000
The lead is a bowed string waveguide.

00:51.000 --> 01:05.000
The kick is an exciter: a struck burst.

01:05.000 --> 01:10.000
Mix shows every track's level, pan and reverb send.

01:10.000 --> 01:38.000
Play bars renders bars 1 and 2 with @osprey/synth.

01:38.000 --> 02:30.000
What you hear is the audio Osprey rendered.
